# Project-context cache (per-checkout, written by /snapshot)
.claude-context.md

# Planning lock (set by /plan during read-only phase)
.claude/.planning-lock

# aims run-state — lives OUTSIDE the Capsa capsule (Capsa §1.5). Holds the
# out-of-capsule inbox, advisory markers, the consolidation throttle
# (.last-consolidated), the ADR-0027 report snapshot (.last-report-snapshot),
# and the ADR-0016 per-session injection ledger (.injected-*). All ephemeral.
.claude/aims-state/

# Pre-write per-session planning-note marker (ADR-0020 inject-once)
.claude/.aims-plan-note-*

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
*.swp
